[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呃！」","art":{"background":"a3238","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在射精前一瞬，我强行将那家伙从她的花瓣里拔了出来。","art":{"background":"a3238","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「嗯！」","art":{"background":"a3247","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"那一瞬，小雨因为受到强烈刺激而挺直了背板。","art":{"background":"a3247","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的下体也被强烈地摩擦了一下。","art":{"background":"a3247","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"来自睾丸的精液一口气经由尿道奔涌出来。","art":{"background":"a3247","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"就这样，我在小雨那白嫩的肌肤上打满了白浊液。","art":{"background":"a3245","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊！」","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"（不断抽动）","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨在我身上颤抖着，全身被精液玷污。","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「呼、呼、呼……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「射得好多啊，主人……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「明明刚刚才射了那么多……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……竟然把本座的身体搞成这样……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨用手沾起粘在她身上的精液，看了看。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的精液从她纤细的手指之中的缝隙间落了下来。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"真是一副淫荡的场景。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但小雨那年幼的脸庞又确实是少女模样。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"少女味与女人味交织在一起，形成了富有魅力的鲜明对比。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"}]